		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="logo-grid">
		<div class="logo-card" data-usd="12"><div><h4 style="color:#fff;margin:0">Wordmark</h4></div><div class="logo-price"><span class="usd">$12</span><span class="kes">KSh 1,548</span></div><div class="logo-desc">A text-only logo focusing entirely on a company's name. Custom typography without symbols.</div><div class="logo-principles"><b>Key Principles</b><div class="principle-item">Strong Typography & Custom Letterforms</div><div class="principle-item">Intentional Kerning for balance</div><div class="principle-item">Distinct Color Palette</div><div class="principle-item">High Scalability on any screen</div></div><div class="logo-examples"><strong>Examples:</strong> Google, Coca-Cola, Visa, NASA, Sony</div><a class="logo-btn" href="#" onclick="orderLogo('Wordmark',12)">Order Wordmark →</a></div>
		<div class="logo-card" data-usd="21"><div><h4 style="color:#fff;margin:0">Monogram</h4></div><div class="logo-price"><span class="usd">$21</span><span class="kes">KSh 2,709</span></div><div class="logo-desc">Typography-based logo made of brand initials (1-3 letters). Compact visual signature.</div><div class="logo-principles"><b>Key Principles</b><div class="principle-item">Interlocking Letters — unified stamp</div><div class="principle-item">Stylized Geometry & Frames</div><div class="principle-item">High Contrast bold weights</div><div class="principle-item">Premium, heritage aesthetic</div></div><div class="logo-examples"><strong>Examples:</strong> Louis Vuitton, CNN, HP, IBM, Chanel</div><a class="logo-btn" href="#" onclick="orderLogo('Monogram',21)">Order Monogram →</a></div>
		<div class="logo-card popular" data-usd="30"><div><h4 style="color:#fff;margin:0">Minimalist - Most Popular</h4></div><div class="logo-price"><span class="usd">From $30</span><span class="kes">KSh 3,870</span></div><div class="logo-desc">Less is more — strips away shadows, gradients. Clean lines, simple geometry, bare essentials.</div><div class="logo-principles"><b>Key Principles</b><div class="principle-item">Clean Lines & Flat Design</div><div class="principle-item">Limited Colors (1-3, monochrome)</div><div class="principle-item">Smart sans-serif Typography</div><div class="principle-item">Negative Space for secondary meaning</div></div><div class="logo-examples"><strong>Examples:</strong> Nike, Apple, Airbnb, FedEx, Calvin Klein</div><a class="logo-btn" href="#" onclick="orderLogo('Minimalist',30)">Order Minimalist →</a></div>
		<div class="logo-card" data-usd="50"><div><h4 style="color:#fff;margin:0">Combination Mark</h4></div><div class="logo-price"><span class="usd">From $50</span><span class="kes">KSh 6,450</span></div><div class="logo-desc">Versatile format integrating both text and separate symbol together.</div><div class="logo-principles"><b>Key Principles</b><div class="principle-item">Visual Balance — no overpowering</div><div class="principle-item">Layout Flexibility — stacked or side-by-side</div><div class="principle-item">Aesthetic Unity — font matches icon weight</div><div class="principle-item">Dual Recognition & Independence</div></div><div class="logo-examples"><strong>Examples:</strong> Adidas, Mastercard, Burger King, Lacoste, Doritos</div><a class="logo-btn" href="#" onclick="orderLogo('Combination Mark',50)">Order Combination →</a></div>
		<div class="logo-card" data-usd="63"><div><h4 style="color:#fff;margin:0">Pictorial</h4></div><div class="logo-price"><span class="usd">From $63</span><span class="kes">KSh 8,127</span></div><div class="logo-desc">Icon or graphic symbol representing real-world object. Literal, recognizable image without text.</div><div class="logo-principles"><b>Key Principles</b><div class="principle-item">Clear Silhouettes — instantly identifiable</div><div class="principle-item">Simplified Realism — stripped details</div><div class="principle-item">High Scalability — app icon to billboard</div><div class="principle-item">Conceptual Metaphor to core promise</div></div><div class="logo-examples"><strong>Examples:</strong> Apple, Target, Twitter, Shell, Starbucks</div><a class="logo-btn" href="#" onclick="orderLogo('Pictorial',63)">Order Pictorial →</a></div>
		<div class="logo-card" data-usd="100"><div><h4 style="color:#fff;margin:0">Abstract</h4></div><div class="logo-price"><span class="usd">From $100</span><span class="kes">KSh 12,900</span></div><div class="logo-desc">Custom geometric shape not representing real-world object. Conceptual lines & symmetry to evoke feeling.</div><div class="logo-principles"><b>Key Principles</b><div class="principle-item">Non-Literal Geometry — total uniqueness</div><div class="principle-item">Metaphorical Shapes for complex values</div><div class="principle-item">Dynamic Symmetry — movement or stability</div><div class="principle-item">Emotional Evocation & Versatility</div></div><div class="logo-examples"><strong>Examples:</strong> Nike, Pepsi, Mitsubishi, Chase, BP</div><a class="logo-btn" href="#" onclick="orderLogo('Abstract',100)">Order Abstract →</a></div>
